00:09.792 --> 00:10.923
- ARE YA READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，准备好了吗？

00:10.967 --> 00:12.925
kids: AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，队长！

00:12.969 --> 00:14.188
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.231 --> 00:16.364
kids: AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，队长！

00:16.407 --> 00:19.367
- O-O-OH!
- 哦哦！

00:19.410 --> 00:21.543
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.586 --> 00:23.197
kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝

00:23.240 --> 00:25.329
