[hums]
[哼哼]

01:11.941 --> 01:14.422
[giant horn blast]
[巨大的号角爆炸]

01:15.684 --> 01:16.641
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:16.685 --> 01:17.990
- GOOD MORNING TO YOU,
TOO, GARY.
- 早上好，
还有，加里。

01:18.034 --> 01:19.427
HELP YOURSELF
TO SOME BREAKFAST KIBBLE,
帮助自己
吃点早餐粗粮，

01:19.470 --> 01:21.385
WHILE I MAKE READY
FOR MY DAY AT...
当我做好准备时
我的一天在...

01:21.429 --> 01:23.474
THE KRUSTY KRAB.
脆皮蟹。

01:25.868 --> 01:27.391
♪ DO-DE-DO,
DO-DE-DO-DO-DO ♪
♪ 做——做——做，
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟 ♪

01:27.435 --> 01:28.610
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:28.653 --> 01:30.394
- FINISHED YOUR BREAKFAST
ALREADY, GAR?
- 吃完早餐
已经，GAR？

01:30.438 --> 01:32.048
WELL, YOU ALWAYS WERE
A GOOD LITTLE EATER.
嗯，你一直都是
一个很好吃的小孩子。

01:33.049 --> 01:34.703
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:34.746 --> 01:36.879
- WE CAN PLAY FETCH
WHEN I GET HOME, GARY.
- 我们可以玩“取球”游戏
当我回到家时，加里。

01:36.922 --> 01:38.446
RIGHT NOW
MR. KRABS NEEDS ME.
现在
先生。蟹蟹需要我。

01:38.489 --> 01:39.838
THERE'S LEFTOVERS IN THE FRIDGE,
IF YOU GET--
冰箱里有剩菜，
如果你得到——

01:39.882 --> 01:42.145
- [meows]
- [screams]
- [喵]
- [尖叫]

01:42.189 --> 01:44.191
GARY,
WHAT HAS GOTTEN INTO YOU?
加里，
你怎么了？

01:44.234 --> 01:46.845
IS THERE SOMETHING IMPORTANT
THAT YOU'D LIKE TO TELL ME?
有什么重要的事情吗
你想告诉我什么？

01:48.064 --> 01:50.153
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:50.197 --> 01:52.155
TODAY IS SUNDAY?
今天是星期天？

01:52.199 --> 01:54.114
BUT THAT MEANS--
但这意味着——

01:54.157 --> 01:55.376
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:55.419 --> 01:57.987
- YEAH. THAT'S EXACTLY RIGHT,
GAR-BEAR.
- 是的。完全正确，
加熊。

01:58.030 --> 01:59.858
I CAN'T GO TO WORK TODAY.
我今天不能去上班。

01:59.902 --> 02:02.905
KRUSTY KRAB
IS CLOSED ON SUNDAYS.
脆皮蟹
周日休息。

02:02.948 --> 02:05.777
GEE, GARY, I WAS REALLY
LOOKING FORWARD TO WORK.
哎呀，加里，我真的
期待工作。

02:05.821 --> 02:08.302
NOW WHAT PURPOSE
COULD TODAY POSSIBLY HAVE?
现在的目的是什么
今天可能有吗？

02:08.345 --> 02:09.912
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

02:09.955 --> 02:11.522
YEAH, MR. KRABS, DID YOU NEED
ME TO COME IN TO WORK TODAY?
是的，先生。蟹蟹，你需要吗？
我今天来上班吗？

02:12.741 --> 02:15.483
OH.
HI, SANDY.
哦。
嗨，桑迪。

02:15.526 --> 02:16.527
YEAH.
是的。

02:17.528 --> 02:18.529
NO.
不。

02:19.791 --> 02:20.531
JUST ME AND GARY.
只有我和加里。

02:22.272 --> 02:23.273
NO, I DON'T KNOW YET.
不，我还不知道。

02:25.362 --> 02:27.059
NAH, I'M NOT SICK.
不，我没病。

02:28.060 --> 02:31.499
YOU NEED A HOUSE SITTER?
TODAY?
您需要保姆吗？
今天？

02:31.542 --> 02:34.066
- THAT'S RIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
I KNOW IT'S LAST MINUTE.
- 没错，海绵宝宝。
我知道这是最后一刻了。

02:34.110 --> 02:36.895
BUT I'M--
- I WOULD LOVE TO.
但我——
- 我很乐意。

02:36.939 --> 02:40.682
- OKAY, SPONGEBOB, MY TREEDOME
IS A HIGHLY TECHNICAL FACILITY,
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，我的树屋
是一个技术含量很高的设施，

02:40.725 --> 02:43.206
AND THERE ARE MANY FACETS
TO ITS OPERATION.
有很多方面
其运作。

02:43.250 --> 02:44.381
SPONGEBOB,
ARE YOU GETTIN' ALL THIS?
海绵宝宝，
你明白这一切了吗？

02:44.425 --> 02:46.122
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

02:46.166 --> 02:48.733
- HERE'S A COMPREHENSIVE LIST
OF DOS AND DONTS TO FOLLOW.
- 这是一个完整的列表
应遵循的注意事项。

02:48.777 --> 02:50.344
- WELL,
THIS LOOKS EASY TO REMEMBER.
- 嗯，
这看起来很容易记住。

02:50.387 --> 02:52.215
IT'S JUST
A LITTLE, BLACK SMUDGE.
这只是
一点点黑色污迹。

02:52.259 --> 02:53.695
- [laughing]
THAT'S TO SAVE PAPER.
- [笑]
这是为了节省纸张。

02:53.738 --> 02:56.045
YOU'LL NEED
A SPECIAL READING SCOPE.
你需要
特殊的阅读范围。

02:57.916 --> 02:59.091
- OH.
- 哦。

02:59.135 --> 03:01.311
- NOW PAY ATTENTION
AS I CLUE YOU IN
- 现在请注意
据我所知

03:01.355 --> 03:03.879
ON SOME OF YOUR
MORE ELABORATE RESPONSIBILITIES.
关于你的一些
更明确的责任。

03:03.922 --> 03:07.012
THIS MAJESTIC STRUCTURE
IS MY KELP GREENHOUSE.
这座雄伟的建筑
是我的海带温室。

03:07.056 --> 03:08.797
ITS FUNCTIONS
ARE COMPLETELY AUTOMATED,
其功能
完全自动化，

03:08.840 --> 03:12.670
SO ALL YOU HAVE TO DO--
- WOW!
所以你所要做的就是——
- 哇！

03:12.714 --> 03:14.281
- IS CHECK THIS THERMOMETER
RIGHT HERE,
- 检查这个温度计
就在这里，

03:14.324 --> 03:16.413
AND MAKE SURE
THE TEMPERATURE IS NORMAL.
并确保
温度正常。

03:17.893 --> 03:21.549
- OR-MAL.
- 奥马尔。

03:21.592 --> 03:22.332
GOT IT.
知道了。

03:23.899 --> 03:25.640
- AND THIS IS
THE ROBOT WAREHOUSE.
- 这是
机器人仓库。

03:25.683 --> 03:27.381
IT'S WHERE I KEEP
ALL MY ROBOTS.
这是我保存的地方
我所有的机器人。

03:27.424 --> 03:28.773
- THAT STANDS TO REASON.
- 这是有道理的。

03:28.817 --> 03:29.818
- THIS PART'S EASY.
- 这部分很简单。

03:29.861 --> 03:31.254
ALLS YOU GOTTA DO
IS COME IN HERE
你必须做的一切
进来了

03:31.298 --> 03:33.038
AND COUNT EVERY SINGLE ONE
OF THESE ROBOTS
并数一数
这些机器人的

03:33.082 --> 03:35.215
AND MAKE SURE
NONE OF 'EM'S GONE MISSING.
并确保
他们都没有失踪。

03:35.258 --> 03:38.479
YOU SEEM TO BE DOIN' A GOOD JOB
PAYIN' ATTENTION, SPONGEBOB.
你看起来做得不错
注意，海绵宝宝。

03:38.522 --> 03:40.481
- I RESPECT
YOUR METICULOUS NATURE.
- 我尊重
你一丝不苟的本性。

03:40.524 --> 03:43.397
- OH.
WHY, THANK YOU, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦。
为什么，谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

03:43.440 --> 03:44.659
- WHAT'S NEXT ON THE LIST?
- 清单上的下一个是什么？

03:44.702 --> 03:46.617
- THIS HERE'S
MY WORM INCUBATOR.
- 这是这里
我的蠕虫孵化器。

03:46.661 --> 03:48.053
THEY'RE NOT SET TO HATCH
FOR WEEKS,
它们还没有准备好孵化
几周来，

03:48.097 --> 03:50.882
BUT I JUST THOUGHT
I'D SHOW IT TO YOU ANYWAY.
但我只是想
无论如何我都会给你看。

03:50.926 --> 03:52.319
AND LAST, BUT NOT LEAST
最后但并非最不重要的一点

03:52.362 --> 03:54.886
IS MY COLLECTION OF RARE
AND FRAGILE ARTIFACTS
我的收藏很稀有吗
和易碎文物

03:54.930 --> 03:57.454
THAT HAS TO BE CLEANED TWICE,
DAILY.
必须清洁两次，
每日。

03:57.498 --> 04:00.892
NOW ARE YOU SURE YOU CAN HANDLE
ALL THAT, SPONGEBOB?
现在您确定可以处理吗
这一切，海绵宝宝？

04:00.936 --> 04:03.634
- TRUST ME, SANDY, YOU'VE GOT
NOTHIN' TO WORRY ABOUT.
- 相信我，桑迪，你已经做到了
无需担心。

04:03.678 --> 04:06.289
YOUR BELOVED TREE HOME
IS IN MY CAPABLE HANDS.
您心爱的树屋
在我能干的手中。

04:06.333 --> 04:08.335
- ARE YA SURE?
- YUP.
- 你确定吗？
- 是的。

04:08.378 --> 04:10.250
- ARE YOU REALLY SURE?
- 你真的确定吗？

04:10.293 --> 04:12.382
- REALLY SURE.
- 真的确定。

04:12.426 --> 04:14.036
- OKAY!
- 好的！

04:26.440 --> 04:28.746
- NORMAL.
- 普通的。

04:28.790 --> 04:31.401
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...
2,692...

04:33.621 --> 04:35.013
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...
2,693...

04:37.799 --> 04:39.409
2,694.
2,694。
2,694。
2,694。
2,694。
2,694。
2,694。
2,694。

04:41.890 --> 04:44.284
[laughs]
[笑]

04:50.464 --> 04:53.684
SANDY SAID THIS COLLECTION
OF RARE AND FRAGILE ARTIFACTS
桑迪说这个系列
稀有且易碎的文物

04:53.728 --> 04:56.426
NEEDS TO BE GENTLY CLEANED,
TWICE, DAILY.
需要轻轻清洁，
每天两次。

04:56.470 --> 04:59.516
THERE WE GO.
NOT A SPECK OF DUST ANYWHERE.
我们开始了。
到处都没有一粒灰尘。

04:59.560 --> 05:01.126
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

05:02.127 --> 05:03.172
AH-HAH!
啊哈！

05:05.566 --> 05:07.742
THERE...WE GO.
那里...我们走了。

05:10.135 --> 05:11.833
WORM INCUBATOR.
蠕虫孵化器。

05:11.876 --> 05:13.269
WELL, LOOKS LIKE
EVERYTHING'S FINE HERE.
嗯，看起来像
这里一切都很好。

05:13.313 --> 05:14.575
[hatching sound]
[孵化声]

05:14.618 --> 05:15.663
WHAT THE--
什么——

05:17.839 --> 05:18.970
[screams] O-O-OH!
[尖叫]噢-噢-噢！

05:19.014 --> 05:20.668
SANDY SAID
THESE WOULDN'T HATCH FOR...
桑迪·赛义德
这些不会孵化......

05:20.711 --> 05:21.712
WEEKS!
几周！

05:21.756 --> 05:23.366
WHAT IS GOING ON?
到底是怎么回事？

05:23.410 --> 05:24.846
WHOA!
PATRICK?
哇啊！
帕特里克？

05:24.889 --> 05:26.630
- SPONGEBOB!
THERE YOU ARE.
- 海绵宝宝！
你就在那里。

05:26.674 --> 05:28.153
- OH, WHAT A RELIEF.
- 哦，真是松了一口气。

05:28.197 --> 05:30.199
I THOUGHT YOU WERE
A HORRIBLE, MUTANT WORM,
我以为你是
一种可怕的变异蠕虫，

05:30.242 --> 05:32.157
WHO WAS ABOUT TO SOAK ME
WITH DIGESTIVE JUICES
谁要泡我
含消化液

05:32.201 --> 05:34.725
AND SLOWLY CONSUME ME
OVER A PERIOD OF WEEKS.
慢慢地消耗我
几周的时间。

05:34.769 --> 05:38.076
- UH, NO THANKS.
I HAD A LATE BREAKFAST.
- 呃，不用了，谢谢。
我早餐吃得很晚。

05:38.120 --> 05:39.991
- WHY ARE YOU WEARING
THAT FUNNY THING ON YOUR HEAD?
- 你为什么穿着
你头上有什么有趣的东西吗？

05:40.035 --> 05:43.691
- WELL, 'CAUSE WE CAN'T BREATHE
IN SANDY'S TREEDOME, 'MEMBER?
- 好吧，因为我们无法呼吸
在桑迪的树穹中，“成员？”

05:43.734 --> 05:45.693
IT'S FILLED WITH AIR.
它充满了空气。

05:45.736 --> 05:47.259
- OH, YEAH,
THANKS FOR REMINDING ME.
- 哦，是的，
谢谢你提醒我。

05:47.303 --> 05:48.609
I ALMOST FORG--
[gasps]
我差点忘记了——
[喘气]

05:48.652 --> 05:50.437
[gasping]
PA-PA-PA-PATRICK!
[喘气]
啪-啪-啪-帕特里克！

05:50.480 --> 05:53.222
HELP! ME! I--I! CAN'T!
B--B--B--
帮助！我！我——我！不能！
乙--乙--乙--

05:53.265 --> 05:54.441
BREATHE!
呼吸！

05:54.484 --> 05:56.617
- THERE YOU GO.
- 好了。

05:56.660 --> 05:58.836
- [breathes deeply]
- [深呼吸]

05:58.880 --> 05:59.968
- AHH.
-啊啊。

06:00.011 --> 06:01.926
THANKS, PATRICK,
YOU'RE A LIFESAVER.
谢谢，帕特里克，
你是救星。

06:01.970 --> 06:04.233
NOW THAT I HAVEN'T SUFFOCATED,
IT'S HIGH TIME
现在我还没有窒息，
现在正是时候

06:04.276 --> 06:06.235
I GOT BACK TO THIS LIST
OF HOUSE-SITTING DUTIES.
我回到这个列表
的看家职责。

06:06.278 --> 06:08.193
SO WITHOUT FURTHER ADO,
PATRICK,
言归正传，
帕特里克，

06:08.237 --> 06:10.805
I'D LIKE TO ASK YOU TO PLEASE
IMMEDIATELY EXIT THE TREEDOME.
我想请你
立即退出树穹。

06:10.848 --> 06:12.415
- UH, EXIT THE--
- 呃，退出--

06:13.808 --> 06:15.244
EXIT THE TREE DOME?
退出树穹？

06:15.287 --> 06:16.419
- THAT'S RIGHT,
EXIT THE TREE--
- 没错，
离开树——

06:16.463 --> 06:18.290
- OH, SPONGEBOB,
THAT'S A GREAT IDEA!
- 哦，海绵宝宝，
这是个好主意！

06:18.334 --> 06:19.814
OH, WHERE SHOULD WE GO?
JELLYFISH FIELDS?
哦，我们应该去哪里？
水母田？

06:19.857 --> 06:22.599
GOO LAGOON? BARG'N MART?
LUCKY LARRY'S?
粘泻湖？巴格恩玛特？
幸运拉里的？

06:22.643 --> 06:24.122
- WELL, LUCKY LARRY'S SOUNDS--
- ALL RIGHT, LET'S GO!
- 好吧，幸运拉里的声音--
- 好吧，我们走吧！

06:24.166 --> 06:25.428
- HOLD IT!
- 坚持住！

06:25.472 --> 06:27.604
I PROMISED SANDY
I'D TAKE EXTRA SPECIAL CARE
我答应过桑迪
我会格外特别小心

06:27.648 --> 06:30.215
OF HER TREEDOME WHILE SHE'S AT
THE INVENTOR'S CONVENTION TODAY.
当她在的时候，她的树穹
今天的发明家大会。

06:30.259 --> 06:32.827
AND THAT IS EXACTLY
WHAT I INTEND TO DO!
正是如此
我打算做什么！

06:32.870 --> 06:35.438
PATRICK,
THIS IS A MAJOR RESPONSIBILITY.
帕特里克，
这是一项重大责任。

06:35.482 --> 06:37.832
- WELL, IN THAT CASE,
I BETTER STAY AND HELP YOU.
- 那么，在这种情况下，
我最好留下来帮助你。

06:37.875 --> 06:39.703
- N-N-N-N-NOPE.
- N-N-N-N-不。

06:39.747 --> 06:41.270
- PLEASE?
- 请？

06:41.313 --> 06:42.445
- NOT GONNA HAPPEN.
- 不会发生的。

06:42.489 --> 06:44.665
- PRETTY PLEASE?
- NO WAY.
- 漂亮吗？
- 决不。

06:44.708 --> 06:46.971
- PRETTY PLEASE WITH
A SCOOP OF VANILLA ICE CREAM?
- 非常满意
一勺香草冰淇淋？

06:47.015 --> 06:48.408
- OH, YEAH, RIGHT.
- 哦，是的，对。

06:48.451 --> 06:50.192
- PRETTY PLEASE WITH
A SCOOP OF STRAWBERRY, VANILLA,
- 非常满意
一勺草莓、香草、

06:50.235 --> 06:52.455
AND CHOCOLATE ICE CREAM,
SMOTHERED IN GOOBERBERRY SAUCE,
和巧克力冰淇淋，
浸泡在果莓酱中，

06:52.499 --> 06:54.718
AND TOPPED WITH HALF A CAN
OF WHIPPED TOPPING?
上面放着半罐
搅打配料？

06:54.762 --> 06:56.154
- PATRICK,
WHAT DO YOU TAKE ME FOR?
- 帕特里克，
你把我当什么？

06:56.198 --> 06:57.460
- AND A SCOOP OF NUTS!
- 还有一勺坚果！

06:57.504 --> 06:58.983
- DEAL.
- HOORAY!
- 交易。
- 万岁！

06:59.027 --> 07:00.811
- BUT YOU HAVE TO PROMISE
NOT TO TOUCH ANYTHING.
- 但你必须承诺
不要碰任何东西。

07:00.855 --> 07:06.208
- I, PATRICK STAR, HEREBY
PROMISE NOT TO TOUCH ANYTHING.
- 我，帕特里克·斯塔特，特此声明
保证不碰任何东西。

07:06.251 --> 07:08.515
- OKAY, NOW LET'S CHECK THE LIST
TO SEE WHAT'S NEXT--
- 好的，现在让我们检查一下列表
看看接下来会发生什么——

07:08.558 --> 07:10.255
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

07:10.299 --> 07:11.822
- PATRICK, NO!
- 帕特里克，不！

07:11.866 --> 07:14.390
- YOU PROMISED ME YOU WEREN'T
GONNA TOUCH ANYTHING!
- 你答应过我你没有
会碰任何东西！

07:14.434 --> 07:16.087
- I WASN'T TOUCHING ANYTHING.
- 我没有碰任何东西。

07:16.131 --> 07:17.567
- THEN WHAT WERE YOU
JUST DOING
- 那你是什么
只是在做

07:17.611 --> 07:18.960
TO SANDY'S COLLECTION OF RARE
AND FRAGILE ARTIFACTS?
前往桑迪的稀有收藏
和易碎文物？

07:19.003 --> 07:20.570
- UM, TASTING IT.
- 嗯，尝尝。

07:20.614 --> 07:22.180
- OKAY, PATRICK,
I INSIST.
- 好吧，帕特里克，
我坚持。

07:22.224 --> 07:25.488
FROM NOW ON, YOU MUST STICK
TO ME AS CLOSELY AS POSSIBLE.
从现在开始，你必须坚持下去
尽可能靠近我。

07:25.532 --> 07:27.316
DO I MAKE MYSELF
PERFECTLY CLEAR?
我做我自己吗
完全清楚吗？

07:27.359 --> 07:31.102
PATRICK, I SAID, DO I MAKE
MYSELF PERF--
帕特里克，我说，我做吗？
我自己的表现--

07:31.146 --> 07:32.190
PATRICK?
帕特里克？

07:32.234 --> 07:35.019
PATRICK?
- IS THIS CLOSE ENOUGH?
帕特里克？
- 这足够接近了吗？

07:35.063 --> 07:36.630
- OKAY, PATRICK.
- 好吧，帕特里克。

07:36.673 --> 07:39.067
TELL ME AGAIN WHAT
IT IS YOU'RE GONNA DO.
再告诉我一下
这是你要做的。

07:39.110 --> 07:41.504
- NOT TOUCH ANYTHING.
- 不要碰任何东西。

07:41.548 --> 07:43.027
- MM-HMM.
WHAT ELSE?
- 嗯嗯。
还有什么？

07:43.071 --> 07:45.682
- NOT...DO ANYTHING.
- 不...做任何事情。

07:45.726 --> 07:46.770
- AND?
- 和？

07:46.814 --> 07:49.338
- NOT...LOOK AT ANYTHING.
- 不...看任何东西。

07:49.381 --> 07:51.862
- UNTIL WHEN?
- 直到什么时候？

07:51.906 --> 07:53.298
UNTIL?
直到？

07:53.342 --> 07:56.519
- UNTIL SPONGEBOB
IS DONE HOUSE-SITTING.
- 直到海绵宝宝
已经完成看家工作了。

07:56.563 --> 07:59.696
- GOOD BOY, PATRICK!
- [barking]
- 好孩子，帕特里克！
- [吠叫]

07:59.740 --> 08:01.568
- WELL, NOW THAT THAT'S SETTLED,
LET'S SEE WHERE I--
- 好吧，既然事情已经解决了，
让我们看看我在哪里——

08:01.611 --> 08:02.656
- SPONGEBOB!
- YES, PATRICK?
- 海绵宝宝！
- 是的，帕特里克？

08:02.699 --> 08:06.268
- UH, CAN I--CAN I--
- 呃，我可以--我可以--

08:06.311 --> 08:09.706
CAN I--CAN I--
CAN I--
我可以--我可以--
我可以——

08:09.750 --> 08:12.492
- PATRICK, HOW MANY TIMES
DID WE--
- 帕特里克，有多少次了
我们有吗——

08:24.765 --> 08:25.809
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

08:25.853 --> 08:27.855
[electronic beeping]
[电子蜂鸣声]

08:39.780 --> 08:41.085
both: UH-OH.
两人：呃-哦。

09:08.025 --> 09:09.853
- WASN'T ME!
- 不是我！

09:09.897 --> 09:11.638
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

09:11.681 --> 09:13.988
WELL, I GUESS I COULDN'T
HANDLE IT AFTER ALL.
好吧，我想我不能
毕竟处理好它。

09:14.031 --> 09:15.467
I--
[sniffs]
我——
[嗅嗅]

09:15.511 --> 09:18.601
I'M A FAILURE!
[sobbing]
我是个失败者！
[抽泣]

09:18.645 --> 09:22.257
- HEY, BUDDY,
IT'S NOT AS BAD AS IT SEEMS.
- 嘿，伙计，
情况并不像看起来那么糟糕。

09:22.300 --> 09:24.346
- OH, YEAH?
WHAT MAKES YOU SAY THAT?
- 哦，是吗？
你为什么这么说？

09:24.389 --> 09:27.654
- WELL, NOT EVERYTHING'S BROKEN.
- 嗯，并不是所有东西都坏了。

09:27.697 --> 09:33.616
- [loud sobbing]
- [大声抽泣]

09:33.660 --> 09:36.358
[gasps]
S-S-S-S-S-S-SA-SANDY!
[喘气]
S-S-S-S-S-S-SA-桑迪！

09:36.401 --> 09:38.360
HOW WAS THE INVENTOR'S
CONVENTION?
发明人的情况如何？
惯例？

09:38.403 --> 09:40.841
- DID YOU BRING BACK
ANY SOUVENIRS?
- 你带回来了吗
有纪念品吗？

09:40.884 --> 09:42.712
- FUNNY Y'ALL SHOULD ASK THAT.
- 有趣的是你们都应该问这个。

09:42.756 --> 09:44.845
- IT IS?
- YEP.
- 这是？
- 是的。

09:44.888 --> 09:47.543
I BROUGHT HOME SOMETHING
REAL HANDY.
我带了一些东西回家
真正方便。

09:47.587 --> 09:50.502
[both gasp and stammer]
[喘息和结巴]

09:50.546 --> 09:53.680
AND I'M SETTING IT
ON MAXIMUM POWER.
我正在设置它
开启最大功率。

09:53.723 --> 09:55.986
- WELL, SPONGEBOB,
I GUESS THIS
- 嗯，海绵宝宝，
我猜这个

09:56.030 --> 09:58.336
IS OUR FINAL GOOD-BYE.
这是我们最后的道别。

09:58.380 --> 10:00.556
- I NEVER THOUGHT I'D
GO OUT LIKE THIS.
- 我从没想过我会
像这样出去。

10:00.600 --> 10:02.427
- AT THE HANDS OF A SQUIRREL?
- 在松鼠手中？

10:02.471 --> 10:04.473
- NO, WITH A FISH BOWL
ON MY HEAD.
- 不，有鱼碗
在我的头上。

10:04.516 --> 10:05.561
[laser gun zaps]
[激光枪扫射]

10:05.605 --> 10:08.172
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

10:22.491 --> 10:24.667
- EUREKA!
IT WORKS!
- 发现了！
有用！

10:24.711 --> 10:26.800
THE EXPERIMENT IS A SUCCESS.
实验取得了成功。

10:26.843 --> 10:28.671
both: EXPERIMENT?
两人：实验？

10:28.715 --> 10:30.194
- THAT'S RIGHT, BOYS.
- 没错，孩子们。

10:30.238 --> 10:32.457
I WANTED YOU TO DESTROY MY HOME
ALL ALONG
我想让你毁掉我的家
一直以来

10:32.501 --> 10:33.981
SO I COULD TEST OUT
THIS HERE NEW
这样我就可以测试一下
这里是新的

10:34.024 --> 10:37.724
RUBBLE-REVERSIN' RAY BLASTER
ON SOME GENUINE RUBBLE.
碎石反转射线冲击波
在一些真正的瓦砾上。

10:37.767 --> 10:40.509
I COULD HAVE JUST SMASHED ALL
THIS STUFF UP MYSELF,
我本可以粉碎一切
这件事让我自己，

10:40.552 --> 10:43.338
BUT NOBODY DESTROYS STUFF QUITE
LIKE Y'ALL.
但没有人会彻底毁坏东西
像你们一样。

10:43.381 --> 10:44.818
YOU'RE NOT A FAILURE,
SPONGEBOB.
你不是失败者，
海绵宝宝。

10:44.861 --> 10:47.603
YOU'RE A SCIENTIST!
你是一名科学家！

10:47.647 --> 10:50.650
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:50.693 --> 10:52.086
- HUH-RAY!
- 哈-射线！

10:52.129 --> 10:54.654
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

10:59.006 --> 11:00.311
all: UH-OH.
所有人：呃-哦。

11:16.719 --> 11:18.460
- WASN'T ME!
- 不是我！

11:18.503 --> 11:20.027
- QUIT YOUR WORRYIN', Y'ALL.
- 别再担心了，你们大家。

11:20.070 --> 11:22.812
I CAN FIX IT ALL
WITH MY HANDY-DANDY
我可以解决这一切
与我的得力助手

11:22.856 --> 11:27.643
RUBBLE-REVERSIN' RAY BLASTER.
碎石反转射线冲击波。

11:27.687 --> 11:31.386
- HA, HA, HA.
- 哈，哈，哈。

11:31.429 --> 11:33.475
- SILLY OLD ROBOT.
- 愚蠢的老机器人。

11:33.518 --> 11:35.738
HE DOESN'T REALIZE YOU HAVE MORE
THAN ONE OF THESE RAY GUNS.
他没有意识到你还有更多
比这些射线枪之一。

11:35.782 --> 11:37.609
ISN'T THAT RIGHT, SANDY?
桑迪，不是吗？

11:37.653 --> 11:39.437
YOU DO HAVE MORE THAN
ONE OF THEM,
您确实拥有超过
其中之一，

11:39.481 --> 11:40.917
DON'T YOU, SANDY?
不是吗，桑迪？

11:40.961 --> 11:44.355
SANDY?
[gulps]
沙？
[吞咽]

11:44.399 --> 11:45.879
- [twitching]
- [抽搐]

11:45.922 --> 11:51.145
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

11:54.017 --> 11:56.977
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:57.020 --> 12:03.070
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:03.113 --> 12:06.073
[smooth jazz playing over radio]
[通过无线电播放流畅的爵士乐]

12:06.116 --> 12:07.422
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:07.465 --> 12:08.510
- ♪ LA-DA-DI
- ♪ 拉-达-迪

12:08.553 --> 12:10.555
♪ LA-DA-DUM-LA-DA-DO
♪ 拉达杜姆拉达多

12:10.599 --> 12:14.342
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

12:14.385 --> 12:20.174
OH, THANK YOU FOR DINING
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
哦，谢谢您的用餐
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

12:20.217 --> 12:23.046
CAN I GIVE YOU A HAND
WITH THAT, SPONGEBOB?
我可以帮你吗
有了这个，海绵宝宝？

12:23.090 --> 12:25.570
- SURE.
THANKS, SQUIDWARD.
- 当然。
谢谢，章鱼哥。

12:25.614 --> 12:28.704
GEE, I GUESS PLAYING KELPY G'S
MUSIC HERE IN THE RESTAURANT
天哪，我猜是在玩 KELPY G'S
餐厅里的音乐

12:28.748 --> 12:29.836
HAS REALLY ENERGIZED HIM.
确实让他充满了活力。

12:29.879 --> 12:31.054
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:31.098 --> 12:32.229
WOW.
哇。

12:32.273 --> 12:34.797
KELPY'S MUSIC IS REALLY,
UM, UNIQUE.
凯尔比的音乐真的是，
嗯，独一无二。

12:34.841 --> 12:36.973
- KELPY'S NOT FOR EVERYONE.
- 凯尔比并不适合所有人。

12:37.017 --> 12:38.366
man on radio:
THAT WAS KELPY G
电台里的人：
那是凯尔比 G

12:38.409 --> 12:41.195
TAKING YOU ON A TRIP
THAT WAS OUT OF THIS OCEAN.
带你去旅行
那是在这片海洋之外。

12:41.238 --> 12:43.588
HOPE ALL OF YOU KELPHEADS GOT
YOUR TICKETS EARLY,
希望你们所有人都能得到
尽早订票，

12:43.632 --> 12:46.330
'CAUSE HIS CONCERT TONIGHT
AT HIGH TIDE STADIUM IS--
因为他今晚的音乐会
涨潮时体育场是——

12:46.374 --> 12:48.506
SORRY--SOLD OUT.
抱歉——已售完。

12:48.550 --> 12:50.247
- OH!
- 哦！

12:50.291 --> 12:52.815
KELPY G IS PERFORMING TONIGHT,
SQUIDWARD!
KELPY G 今晚表演，
章鱼哥！

12:52.859 --> 12:54.034
BUT TICKETS ARE...
但门票是...

12:54.077 --> 12:56.514
[imitating man on radio]
SORRY--SOLD OUT.
[在广播中模仿男人]
抱歉——已售完。

12:56.558 --> 12:58.429
- OH!
HOW COULD THIS BE?
- 哦！
怎么会这样？

12:58.473 --> 13:00.518
WHATEVER SHALL I DO?
我该怎么办？

13:00.562 --> 13:02.346
- YOU FORGOT TO BUY A TICKET?
- 您忘记买票了吗？

13:02.390 --> 13:03.695
- OH, NO.
I HAVE A TICKET.
- 哦，不。
我有一张票。

13:03.739 --> 13:05.785
I JUST DON'T KNOW
WHAT I'LL DO
我只是不知道
我要做什么

13:05.828 --> 13:07.917
WITHOUT YOU THERE.
没有你在。

13:07.961 --> 13:09.310
OH, WAIT,
I JUST REALIZED...
哦，等等，
我刚刚意识到...

13:09.353 --> 13:12.269
I'LL BE HAVING
THE GREATEST TIME OF MY LIFE!
我将会有
我一生中最美好的时光！

13:12.313 --> 13:14.706
- SQUIDWARD, MAY I AT LEAST
GAZE UPON YOUR TICKET?
- 章鱼哥，至少可以吗
查看您的门票吗？

13:14.750 --> 13:15.925
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

13:15.969 --> 13:18.449
I SHOW YOU THE TICKET
AND THEN
我给你看票
然后

13:18.493 --> 13:20.495
THROUGH SOME MANNER
OF FOLLY,
通过某种方式
愚蠢的，

13:20.538 --> 13:22.236
YOU DESTROY IT!
你毁了它！

13:22.279 --> 13:26.066
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

13:26.109 --> 13:28.851
- YOU'RE PROBABLY NOT GONNA GET
THAT BACK BEFORE SHOWTIME.
- 你可能不会得到
那是在演出之前。

13:28.895 --> 13:30.592
- THIS GOES TO ALL THOSE
SAD SACKS
- 这适用于所有这些
悲伤麻袋

13:30.635 --> 13:32.507
WITHOUT A TICKET
TO TONIGHT'S CONCERT.
无票
参加今晚的音乐会。

13:32.550 --> 13:35.989
WE'RE GIVING AWAY THE LAST
TWO TICKETS TO ONE LUCKY CALLER.
我们正在放弃最后的
两张门票送给一位幸运的来电者。

13:36.032 --> 13:39.166
- OH, THE DREAM
IS STILL ALIVE!
- 哦，梦想
还活着！

13:39.209 --> 13:40.471
[phone dialing]
[电话拨号]

13:40.515 --> 13:43.344
- HEY, YOU ARE
LUCKY LOSER NUMBER ONE.
- 嘿，你是
幸运的失败者排名第一。

13:43.387 --> 13:45.128
PLEASE TRY AGAIN.
[phone dialing]
请再试一次。
[电话拨号]

13:45.172 --> 13:47.435
HEY, YOU ARE LUCKY LOSER
NUMBER FIVE.
嘿，你是幸运的失败者
第五。

13:47.478 --> 13:49.524
PLEASE TRY AGAIN.
[phone dialing]
请再试一次。
[电话拨号]

13:49.567 --> 13:51.700
HEY, YOU ARE LUCKY LOSER
NUMBER NINE.
嘿，你是幸运的失败者
九号。

13:51.743 --> 13:53.571
PLEASE TRY AGAIN.
22--TRY AGAIN.
请再试一次。
22--再试一次。

13:53.615 --> 13:55.008
[beep]
27.
[嘟嘟声]
27.

13:55.051 --> 13:56.400
[beep]
65.
[嘟嘟声]
65.

13:56.444 --> 13:57.793
- OH, COME ON!
- 哦，来吧！

13:57.837 --> 13:59.360
[phone trilling]
NOTHING BUT A SCAM.
[电话颤音]
只不过是一个骗局。

13:59.403 --> 14:00.665
- HELLO.
- 你好。

14:00.709 --> 14:03.103
YOU'RE WINNING CALLER
NUMBER 102.
您赢得了来电者
102号。

14:03.146 --> 14:04.931
- I AM?
- 我是？

14:04.974 --> 14:06.236
[busy signal]
[忙碌信号]

14:06.280 --> 14:08.064
- NOT ONLY HAVE YOU WON
TWO FRONT-ROW SEATS,
- 不仅仅是你赢了
两个前排座位，

14:08.108 --> 14:10.762
BUT YOU AND A FRIEND WILL
GO BACKSTAGE
但你和你的朋友会
前往后台

14:10.806 --> 14:12.982
TO MEET KELPY G HIMSELF.
认识 KELPY G 本人。

14:13.026 --> 14:15.942
- ME AND A FRIEND.
- 我和一个朋友。

14:15.985 --> 14:17.073
HMM.
唔。

14:17.117 --> 14:20.468
I WONDER WHO THAT WILL BE?
我想知道那会是谁？

14:20.511 --> 14:23.210
[smooth jazz playing]
【流畅的爵士乐演奏】

14:23.253 --> 14:24.515
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

14:24.559 --> 14:26.735
OOH, CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?
哦，你能相信吗？

14:26.778 --> 14:30.826
WE'RE GONNA MEET YOUR HERO,
KELPY G.
我们要见见你的英雄，
凯尔皮·G.

14:30.870 --> 14:32.262
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

14:32.306 --> 14:35.875
SO NICE TO BE SURROUNDED
BY SUCH KINDRED SPIRITS.
很高兴被包围
靠着这样的志同道合的人。

14:35.918 --> 14:37.267
- YOU CAN SAY THAT AGAIN.
- 你可以再说一遍。

14:37.311 --> 14:38.355
IT'S A RARE TREAT
TO MINGLE
这是一种难得的享受
打成一片

14:38.399 --> 14:40.705
WITH TRUE DIEHARD
SMOOTH JAZZISTS.
与真正的顽固分子
流畅的爵士乐手。

14:40.749 --> 14:42.272
- YOU SAID IT, LADY!
- 你说过了，女士！

14:42.316 --> 14:44.709
I'VE BEEN A DIEHARD
SINCE 10:00 THIS MORNING!
我一直是个顽固分子
从今天早上 10:00 开始！

14:44.753 --> 14:50.367
WHO'S READY FOR
A KELPY G CONCERT TONIGHT?
谁准备好了
今晚有 KELPY G 音乐会吗？

14:50.411 --> 14:54.284
- WAS IT YOU WHO BROUGHT
THE RAUCOUS MISCREANT?
- 是你带来的吗
喧闹的恶棍？

14:54.328 --> 14:56.939
- ME?
NO, COURSE NOT, NO.
- 我？
不，当然不，不。

14:56.983 --> 14:59.942
SEE ALL YOU FELLOW KELPHEADS
AT THE SHOW.
看看你们所有的海藻同胞
在展会上。

14:59.986 --> 15:04.033
- JUST KEEP YOUR FRIEND'S
OUTBURSTS UNDER CONTROL.
- 保留你朋友的
爆发得到控制。

15:04.077 --> 15:08.472
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

15:08.516 --> 15:09.996
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

15:10.039 --> 15:11.649
- ISN'T THIS SO MUCH FUN,
SQUIDWARD?
- 这不是很有趣吗
章鱼哥？

15:11.693 --> 15:14.652
WHOA, I LOVE YOUR KELPY G WIG,
SIR.
哇，我喜欢你的 KELPY G 假发，
先生。

15:14.696 --> 15:15.740
- WHAT WIG?
- 什么假发？

15:15.784 --> 15:17.438
- COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
- 来吧，海绵宝宝。

15:17.481 --> 15:20.441
SPONGEBOB'S OBNOXIOUSNESS
IS OSTRACIZING ME
海绵宝宝的讨厌之处
正在排斥我

15:20.484 --> 15:21.790
FROM ALL THESE OTHER FANS.
来自所有其他粉丝。

15:21.833 --> 15:23.966
SOMEHOW I GOT TO GIVE HIM
THE SLIP.
不知何故我必须给他
失误。

15:24.010 --> 15:25.141
- WHOA.
- 哇哦。

15:25.185 --> 15:30.146
JUST LOOK AT THAT LEMONADE LINE.
看看那条柠檬水线。

15:30.190 --> 15:31.931
- HA!
THAT'S IT.
- 哈！
就是这样。

15:31.974 --> 15:34.237
UH, HANG ON, SPONGEBOB.
呃，坚持住，海绵宝宝。

15:34.281 --> 15:35.978
I NEED A REST.
我需要休息。

15:36.022 --> 15:37.719
MY THROAT IS PARCHED.
我的喉咙很干。

15:37.762 --> 15:39.590
I SURE WISH I KNEW
WHERE ONE
我确实希望我知道
凡一

15:39.634 --> 15:42.028
COULD PROCURE SOME LEMONADE.
可以买一些柠檬水。

15:42.071 --> 15:43.464
- MMM, YEAH.
- 嗯，是的。

15:43.507 --> 15:45.945
- I SAID, "I WONDER
WHERE SOMEONE
- 我说，“我想知道
有人在哪里

15:45.988 --> 15:47.033
COULD GET SOME LEMONADE."
可以喝点柠檬水。”

15:47.076 --> 15:48.251
- YEAH.
- D'OH!
- 是的。
- 天啊！

15:48.295 --> 15:49.339
IT'S RIGHT BEHIND YOU,
SPONGEBOB!
它就在你身后，
海绵宝宝！

15:49.383 --> 15:51.907
- OH!
- 哦！

15:51.951 --> 15:52.995
WHY DON'T I GET ONE FOR YOU?
我为什么不给你买一个？

15:53.039 --> 15:54.127
- OH, NO.
DEAR ME.
- 哦，不。
亲爱的我。

15:54.170 --> 15:55.519
OH, NO.
哦，不。

15:55.563 --> 15:56.477
I COULD NOT HAVE YOU WAIT
我不能让你等

15:56.520 --> 15:57.869
IN THAT LONG LINE,
SPONGEBOB.
在那长长的队伍中，
海绵宝宝。

15:57.913 --> 15:59.045
- IT'S NO PROBLEM,
SQUIDWARD.
- 没问题，
章鱼哥。

15:59.088 --> 16:00.176
REALLY, I--
- WELL, OKAY.
真的，我——
- 好吧，好吧。

16:00.220 --> 16:01.351
SINCE YOU INSIST.
- ALL RIGHT.
既然你坚持了。
- 好的。

16:01.395 --> 16:03.136
ONE LEMONADE COMING UP.
一杯柠檬水即将到来。

16:03.179 --> 16:04.224
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

16:04.267 --> 16:07.096
SEE YOU AFTER THE SHOW,
SPONGY G.
演出结束后见，
海绵G.

16:07.140 --> 16:09.011
[group snapping fingers]
[集体打响指]

16:09.055 --> 16:11.579
AHH, "TURQUOISE SCALLOP
SUN DANCE."
啊，“绿松石扇贝
太阳舞。”

16:11.622 --> 16:13.189
I JUST LOVE THIS TUNE.
我就是喜欢这首曲子。

16:13.233 --> 16:14.538
- HEY, HEY.
- 嘿，嘿。

16:14.582 --> 16:17.106
A FELLOW MELLOW-JAZZ DAZZLER.
一位令人眼花缭乱的柔和爵士乐手。

16:17.150 --> 16:18.368
WHAT'S HAPPENING?
发生了什么事？

16:18.412 --> 16:19.804
- OH, JUST GROOVING
TO THE SOOTHING WAVES
- 哦，只是开槽
舒缓的海浪

16:19.848 --> 16:21.241
OF GENTLE G.
温柔的G。

16:21.284 --> 16:24.244
- OH, I'M PICKING UP
WHAT YOU'RE LAYING DOWN.
- 哦，我正在接电话
你正在放下什么。

16:24.287 --> 16:26.115
YOU CAN GROOZE WITH US ANYTIME.
您可以随时与我们一起狂欢。

16:26.159 --> 16:27.595
- DON'T MIND IF I DO GROOVE.
- 如果我喜欢，请不要介意。

16:27.638 --> 16:29.292
- [laughs]
- [笑]

16:29.336 --> 16:30.250
LOOK WHAT I FOUND!
看看我发现了什么！

16:30.293 --> 16:31.599
- WHAT THE--HOW--WHAT?
- 什么--如何--什么？

16:31.642 --> 16:34.819
- GUESS WHAT.
THERE'S A SECOND LEMONADE STAND!
- 你猜怎么着。
还有第二个柠檬水摊！

16:34.863 --> 16:36.343
[laughs]
[笑]

16:36.386 --> 16:38.345
HEY, NICE TUNE.
嘿，曲子好听。

16:38.388 --> 16:39.476
[strums ukulele]
[弹奏尤克里里]

16:39.520 --> 16:40.695
NOTHING LIKE A LITTLE
ACCOMPANIMENT
没有一点点
伴奏

16:40.738 --> 16:41.957
TO BRING OUT
THE GENIUS
拿出来
天才

16:42.001 --> 16:44.090
OF KELPY'S KAZOO PLAYING,
HUH, GUYS?
凯尔比的卡祖笛演奏，
嗯，伙计们？

16:44.133 --> 16:45.221
- KAZOO?
- 卡祖笛？

16:45.265 --> 16:47.310
YOUR FRIEND OBVIOUSLY
KNOWS NOTHING
显然是你的朋友
一无所知

16:47.354 --> 16:48.920
OF KELPY G, MAN.
凯尔皮·G，曼。

16:48.964 --> 16:50.226
- ARE YOU FRIENDS
WITH SQUIDWARD?
- 你们是朋友吗
和章鱼哥一起？

16:50.270 --> 16:52.533
- FRIENDS?
I SHOULD THINK NOT.
- 朋友们？
我认为不会。

16:52.576 --> 16:55.840
WE ONLY ASSOCIATE
WITH TRUE JAZZ DAZZLERS.
我们只合作
真正的爵士乐令人眼花缭乱。

16:55.884 --> 16:56.972
- BUT--BUT I DAZZLE.
- 但是 - 但我眼花缭乱。

16:57.016 --> 16:58.800
I--
[groans]
我——
[呻吟]

17:03.022 --> 17:04.414
- WHOO!
- 呼！

17:04.458 --> 17:06.851
KELPY!
YEAH!
海尔比！
是的！

17:06.895 --> 17:08.897
PUT YOUR HANDS TOGETHER,
PEOPLE!
双手合十，
人们！

17:08.940 --> 17:10.203
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

17:10.246 --> 17:11.639
- HEY, SPONGE,
WOULD YOU SIT DOWN
- 嘿，海绵，
你能坐下吗

17:11.682 --> 17:13.293
AND SHUT YOUR MOUTH?
并闭上你的嘴吗？

17:13.336 --> 17:16.078
- WELL, THANK YOU
FOR SPEAKING OUT.
- 好的，谢谢
为了发声。

17:16.122 --> 17:17.471
- I HAD TO.
- 我必须这么做。

17:17.514 --> 17:19.299
- HELLO ALL YOU SNAZZY JAZZLERS.
- 大家好，各位时髦的爵士乐手。

17:19.342 --> 17:22.215
PLEASE PUT YOUR THUMBS
AND FOREFINGERS TOGETHER
请竖起大拇指
和食指并拢

17:22.258 --> 17:24.304
AND GIVE A WARM WELCOME TO...
并热烈欢迎...

17:24.347 --> 17:26.915
THE PIED PIPER
OF JAZZ HIMSELF,
花衣魔笛手
爵士乐本人，

17:26.958 --> 17:29.004
KELPY G.
凯尔皮·G.

17:29.048 --> 17:35.054
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

17:38.840 --> 17:40.276
[audience oohs]
[观众哦]

17:40.320 --> 17:44.367
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

17:44.411 --> 17:47.066
[applause]
- BRAVO! BRAVO!
[鼓掌]
- 太棒了！太棒了！

17:47.109 --> 17:50.417
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

17:50.460 --> 17:51.853
- WOW!
- 哇！

17:51.896 --> 17:54.160
- SUCH IMMACULATE MUSIC.
- 如此完美的音乐。

17:54.203 --> 17:57.206
IT'S THE VERY VOICE
OF NEPTUNE HIMSELF.
这就是声音
海王星本人。

17:57.250 --> 17:58.294
- EXCUSE ME, SIR.
- 对不起，先生。

17:58.338 --> 17:59.948
DO YOU HAVE ANY KETCHUP?
你们有番茄酱吗？

17:59.991 --> 18:01.428
- NO, I DON'T THINK--
WHAT? KETCHUP?
- 不，我不认为--
什么？番茄酱？

18:01.471 --> 18:03.082
- PATRICK,
WHAT BROUGHT YOU HERE?
- 帕特里克，
是什么让你来到这里？

18:03.125 --> 18:05.084
- TWO WORDS, SPONGEBOB:
- 两个词，海绵宝宝：

18:05.127 --> 18:06.389
NA...CHOS.
不……不。

18:06.433 --> 18:10.132
- OH!
TWO WORDS, PATRICK: GET LOST.
- 哦！
两个字，帕特里克：迷路。

18:10.176 --> 18:11.481
- WHAT'S THAT?
- 那是什么？

18:11.525 --> 18:13.266
- OH, NO, YOU DON'T,
PATRICK!
- 哦，不，你不，
帕特里克！

18:13.309 --> 18:14.832
YOU STAY AWAY
FROM MY BACKSTAGE--
你远离
从我的后台——

18:14.876 --> 18:18.009
[stammering]
AH!
[结巴]
啊！

18:18.053 --> 18:20.142
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

18:20.186 --> 18:21.361
- IT'S OKAY, SQUIDWARD.
- 没关系，章鱼哥。

18:21.404 --> 18:23.363
YOU'RE THE BIGGEST KELPY G FAN
I KNOW.
您是 KELPY G 的忠实粉丝
我知道。

18:23.406 --> 18:26.105
PLEASE TAKE
MY BACKSTAGE PA--
请拿走
我的后台 PA--

18:26.148 --> 18:29.282
- [chewing loudly and slurping]
- [大声咀嚼并发出声音]

18:29.325 --> 18:30.500
[belches]
[打嗝]

18:30.544 --> 18:32.023
[stomach growls]
[肚子咕咕叫]

18:32.067 --> 18:34.722
TUMMY WANT MORE.
肚子想要更多。

18:34.765 --> 18:35.940
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

18:35.984 --> 18:37.116
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

18:37.159 --> 18:38.247
I AM GONNA GET
THOSE PASSES BACK
我会得到
那些回传

18:38.291 --> 18:40.554
EVEN IF I HAVE TO RIP PATRICK
IN HALF!
即使我必须撕破帕特里克
一半！

18:40.597 --> 18:41.685
WHAT THE--
什么——

18:41.729 --> 18:43.861
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

18:43.905 --> 18:45.994
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

18:46.037 --> 18:48.344
UH, UH, UH...
呃，呃，呃……

18:48.388 --> 18:51.260
I WOULD LIKE TWO EXTRA-CHEESY
NACHOS
我想要两份特别芝士味的
玉米片

18:51.304 --> 18:53.219
WITH A SIDE OF CHEESE
配奶酪

18:53.262 --> 18:55.308
AND TWO VANILLA CORAL SHAKES.
和两杯香草珊瑚奶昔。

18:55.351 --> 18:57.223
UH, ACTUALLY,
MAKE THAT
呃，实际上，
做到这一点

18:57.266 --> 18:59.268
TWO CHEESE CORAL SHAKES.
两杯奶酪珊瑚奶昔。

18:59.312 --> 19:01.183
AND INSTEAD OF WHIP CREAM
ON TOP,
代替鲜奶油
在上面，

19:01.227 --> 19:03.620
I'LL TAKE CREAM CHEESE
ON THE BOTTOM.
我要奶油奶酪
在底部。

19:03.664 --> 19:07.015
THAT'S IT FOR NOW.
现在就这样。

19:07.058 --> 19:08.190
- GET HIM!
- 抓住他！

19:08.234 --> 19:09.800
[mic feedback]
[麦克风反馈]

19:09.844 --> 19:11.106
[cheering]
[欢呼]

19:11.150 --> 19:12.151
- [laughs]
- [笑]

19:12.194 --> 19:13.195
- I FEEL SO ALIVE.
- 我感觉自己充满活力。

19:13.239 --> 19:14.544
- HEY, COME BACK HERE
- 嘿，回到这里

19:14.588 --> 19:16.111
WITH THOSE BACKSTAGE PASSES!
有了那些后台通行证！

19:16.155 --> 19:18.722
- [laughs]
- [笑]

19:18.766 --> 19:20.071
- WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA!
- 哇，哇，哇，哇！

19:20.115 --> 19:21.247
WHERE DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE GOING?
你认为在哪里
你要去吗？

19:21.290 --> 19:22.596
- BUT OUR--OUR FRIEND
JUST TOOK OUR--
- 但是我们的——我们的朋友
刚刚拿走了我们的——

19:22.639 --> 19:24.032
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.
- 是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊。

19:24.075 --> 19:25.773
I DON'T CARE ABOUT THE WHOSITS
OR THE WHATSITS.
我不关心那些谁
或那些什么。

19:25.816 --> 19:28.210
CLEAR THE AISLE AND GO BACK
TO YOUR SEAT.
清理过道并返回
到您的座位上。

19:28.254 --> 19:29.864
- OH, WELL.
- 那好吧。

19:29.907 --> 19:32.693
AT LEAST WE STILL HAVE
OUR SEATS.
至少我们还有
我们的座位。

19:32.736 --> 19:34.173
[growling]
[咆哮]

19:34.216 --> 19:38.133
- YOU GOT A PROBLEM,
TENTACLE HEAD?
- 你有问题了，
触手头？

19:38.177 --> 19:39.395
- YEAH, I GOT A PROBLEM.
- 是的，我遇到了问题。

19:39.439 --> 19:41.223
THOSE ARE MY SEATS,
YOU NUMBSKULL!
这些是我的座位，
你这个笨蛋！

19:41.267 --> 19:42.442
I'M GONNA RANT FOR A WHILE.
我要咆哮一会儿。

19:42.485 --> 19:43.617
YOU'RE JUST GONNA SIT THERE,
AREN'T YOU?
你只要坐在那里，
你不是吗？

19:43.660 --> 19:44.661
YOU'RE NOT GONNA MOVE AT ALL.
你根本不会动。

19:44.705 --> 19:46.968
WE WAITED LONG AND HARD
FOR THIS.
我们苦苦等待
为此。

19:49.100 --> 19:50.276
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

19:50.319 --> 19:52.626
TONIGHT'S RUINED.
今晚就毁了。

19:52.669 --> 19:54.889
A COMPLETE DISASTER.
一场彻底的灾难。

19:54.932 --> 19:58.588
AND I DIDN'T EVEN
MEET KELPY G.
我什至没有
认识 KELPY G。

19:58.632 --> 19:59.589
- KEEP IT JAZZY, MILES.
- 保持爵士乐，英里。

19:59.633 --> 20:05.552
HEY, THANKS FOR THE GRUB.
嘿，谢谢你的 GRUB。

20:05.595 --> 20:07.510
- WE'RE IN, SPONGEBOB.
- 我们进来了，海绵宝宝。

20:07.554 --> 20:09.164
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

20:09.208 --> 20:13.386
NOW I'LL FINALLY GET TO MEET
THE INCOMPARABLE KELPY--
现在我终于要见面了
无与伦比的凯尔比--

20:13.429 --> 20:15.388
- HEY!
THIS IS A PRIVATE AREA!
- 嘿！
这是私人区域！

20:15.431 --> 20:18.347
ONLY PEOPLE WITH BACKSTAGE
PASSES CAN COME BACK HERE!
只有有后台的人
通行证可以回到这里！

20:18.391 --> 20:21.220
- OH, WELL, YOU SEE, SIR,
WE HAD BACKSTAGE PASSES,
- 哦，好吧，你看，先生，
我们有后台通行证，

20:21.263 --> 20:22.917
BUT MY FRIEND ATE 'EM
WITH HIS NACHOS.
但我的朋友吃了它们
和他的玉米片。

20:22.960 --> 20:24.266
THEN HE DOVE OFF THE STAGE
AND GOT
然后他跳下舞台
并得到了

20:24.310 --> 20:25.702
CARRIED AWAY BY THE AUDIENCE.
深受观众喜爱。

20:25.746 --> 20:27.704
- WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?
- 你在说什么？

20:27.748 --> 20:29.576
I'M KELPY G'S MANAGER.
我是 KELPY G 的经理。

20:29.619 --> 20:32.622
NOW READ MY LIPS.
现在读我的嘴唇。

20:32.666 --> 20:34.885
- "NO BACKSTAGE PASSES,
NO ENTRY."
- “没有后台通行证，
禁止入内。”

20:34.929 --> 20:35.886
HUH?
嗯？

20:35.930 --> 20:39.281
- AND NO SEEING KELPY G!
GOT IT?
- 没有看到 KELPY G！
知道了？

20:39.325 --> 20:41.065
- OH, PLEASE!
- 哦，拜托！

20:41.109 --> 20:43.024
PLEASE LET ME SEE HIM!
请让我见见他！

20:43.067 --> 20:45.592
PLEASE! PLEASE! PLEASE!
请！请！请！

20:45.635 --> 20:47.202
- GET UP, MAN.
- 站起来，伙计。

20:47.246 --> 20:48.551
HAVE SOME DIGNITY.
有尊严。

20:48.595 --> 20:51.989
- BUT--BUT--BUT WHAT IF
I TOLD YOU, UH...
-但是--但是--但是如果怎么样
我告诉过你了，呃...

20:52.033 --> 20:53.817
I'M--I'M A CLARINET
PLAYER MYSELF?
我是单簧管
玩家本人？

20:53.861 --> 20:55.297
- [groans]
- YEAH.
- [呻吟]
- 是的。

20:55.341 --> 20:57.212
I CALL THIS ONE
"NINTH MOVEMENT:
我称之为
“第九乐章：

20:57.256 --> 20:59.127
A KALEIDOSCOPE OF STARS."
星星的万花筒。”

20:59.170 --> 21:00.694
WAIT, HOLD FOR IT.
[deep breath]
等等，坚持下去。
[深呼吸]

21:00.737 --> 21:02.348
[squeaky clarinet playing]
[吱吱作响的单簧管演奏]

21:02.391 --> 21:04.132
- OH! OH!
- 哦！哦！

21:04.175 --> 21:07.831
[strums ukulele]
[弹奏尤克里里]

21:07.875 --> 21:11.357
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

21:11.400 --> 21:13.010
- RIGHT THIS WAY, MR. G.
- 这边走，先生。 G。

21:13.054 --> 21:14.098
- [sighs]
ANOTHER SHOW,
- [叹气]
另一个节目，

21:14.142 --> 21:15.926
ANOTHER INTERMISSION.
又是一次中场休息。

21:15.970 --> 21:17.885
- YOUR DRESSING ROOM
IS RIGHT OVER HERE, SIR.
- 你的更衣室
就在这里，先生。

21:17.928 --> 21:19.887
- HOLD ON A SMOOTH SECOND.
- 稍等一下。

21:19.930 --> 21:21.671
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

21:21.715 --> 21:22.933
- UGH!
- 呃！

21:22.977 --> 21:24.108
WHO LET THOSE TWO BACK HERE?
谁让那两个人回来的？

21:24.152 --> 21:25.545
THAT SOUNDS HORRIBLE!
听起来很可怕！

21:25.588 --> 21:27.155
I'LL GET 'EM RIGHT OUT.
- NO, NO.
我会马上把他们救出来。
- 不，不。

21:27.198 --> 21:29.940
I AGREE THE CLARINET
SOUNDS ABYSMAL.
我同意单簧管
听起来很糟糕。

21:29.984 --> 21:31.333
BUT THAT UKULELE?
但是尤克里里琴呢？

21:31.377 --> 21:32.987
GENIUS.
天才。

21:33.030 --> 21:34.771
AND HIS CLOGS,
还有他的木鞋，

21:34.815 --> 21:36.599
THEY'RE JUST LIKE MINE, SEE?
他们就像我的一样，看到了吗？

21:36.643 --> 21:38.906
EXCUSE ME, YOUNG MAN.
对不起，年轻人。

21:38.949 --> 21:39.994
- HELLO, KELPY.
- 你好，凯尔比。

21:40.037 --> 21:41.735
IT'S GREAT TO FINALLY MEET--
OH.
很高兴终于见面——
哦。

21:41.778 --> 21:44.172
- AND WHAT MIGHT YOU
BE CALLED?
- 你可能会做什么
被召唤？

21:44.215 --> 21:46.043
- SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
- 海绵宝宝。

21:46.087 --> 21:47.480
- COME, YOUNG PROTEGE.
- 来吧，年轻的门徒。

21:47.523 --> 21:51.527
LET US WOO THE CROWD WITH SOUNDS
OF HEAVENLY DELIGHT.
让我们用声音吸引观众
天国的喜悦。

21:53.790 --> 21:57.664
[crowd chanting in whisper]
KELPY, KELPY, KELPY,
[人群低声呼喊]
凯尔比，凯尔比，凯尔比，

21:57.707 --> 21:58.839
KELPY.
凯尔比。

21:58.882 --> 21:59.927
- OH, THERE HE IS.
- 哦，他在那儿。

21:59.970 --> 22:00.928
[applause]
[掌声]

22:00.971 --> 22:03.322
- AT THIS TIME,
- 此时，

22:03.365 --> 22:07.064
I'D LIKE TO WELCOME A VERY
SPECIAL GUEST TO THE STAGE.
我想欢迎一位非常
舞台特邀嘉宾。

